    "lawCode": "Add §343-aa, Hway L",
    "lawSection": "Highway Law",
    "memo": "BILL NUMBER:S3550\n\nTITLE  OF BILL:   An act to amend the highway law, in relation to desig-\nnating a portion of state  highway  in  Erie  county  as  the  \"Sergeant\nWilliam R. Wilson III Memorial Highway\"\n\nPURPOSE:  To  designate  a  portion of the interstate highway 990 as the\n\"Sergeant William R. Wilson III Memorial Highway.\"\n\nSUMMARY: Section 1 amends the highway law by adding a new section,  343-\naa  in  order  that a portion of interstate highway 990 be designated as\nthe \"Sergeant William R. Wilson III Memorial Highway.\"\n\nSection 2 provides the enacting clause.\n\nJUSTIFICATION: This legislation would celebrate the late  US  Army  Sgt.\nWilliam  R.  Wilson  III,  of  Getzville, in Erie County, who was killed\nMarch 26, 2012, while serving in Afghanistan. Sergeant Wilson was killed\nin Paktika Province, in  Eastern  Afghanistan,  where  he  was  training\nAfghan  soldiers and police to take over the country's security when the\nUnited States withdraws from Afghanistan in 2014.\n\nLEGISLATIVE HISTORY: New bill\n\nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS: None. Current project costs will cover the signage.\n\nEFFECTIVE DATE: This act shall take effect immediately.\n\n",
